00:06:31.625 --> 00:06:32.436
Well it's weird.


00:06:32.460 --> 00:06:34.438
No it's not.


00:06:35.663 --> 00:06:38.231
Todd, no I'm not in the mood.


00:06:39.399 --> 00:06:41.902
You're never in the mood, Jess.


