see you around.


00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:09.142
See you around.


00:15:30.630 --> 00:15:32.841
Miss McCallister.


00:15:32.865 --> 00:15:34.801
Please, it's Delilah.


00:15:37.204 --> 00:15:38.038
Delilah.


00:15:40.507 --> 00:15:43.452
