make any friends.


00:16:52.345 --> 00:16:54.423
Oh, wow, that's all right.


00:16:54.447 --> 00:16:57.160
Well we have plenty of
drama in this family.


00:16:57.184 --> 00:16:59.962
Remember it's a small town.


00:16:59.986 --> 00:17:01.597
