00:34:43.482 --> 00:34:46.928
Okay, so you don't
like her obviously.


00:34:46.952 --> 00:34:49.955
Nope, now I have
to live with her.


00:34:50.989 --> 00:34:52.057
That sucks.


00:34:53.091 --> 00:34:54.669
Yeah.


00:34:54.693 --> 00:34:57.272
