burning her skin off.


00:35:10.642 --> 00:35:11.853
What?


00:35:11.877 --> 00:35:13.988
Nothing, nothing.


00:35:14.012 --> 00:35:18.493
Anyway, she went crazy and
it made my parents fight.


00:35:18.517 --> 00:35:19.827
