boy, did you find a chicken?


00:36:45.871 --> 00:36:46.705
Hello?


00:36:48.106 --> 00:36:48.940
Hello.


00:36:53.144 --> 00:36:54.121
Shae?


00:36:54.145 --> 00:36:55.457
Shae, it's me Mike.


00:36:55.481 --> 00:36:57.549
