00:37:21.973 --> 00:37:24.118
Screwin' around in the kitchen.


00:37:28.947 --> 00:37:30.525
Delilah.


00:37:30.549 --> 00:37:31.559
Mike.


00:37:31.583 --> 00:37:33.084
We have to talk.


00:37:34.119 --> 00:37:35.297
