00:37:35.321 --> 00:37:36.898
The people you moved
into Amity house,


00:37:36.922 --> 00:37:38.433
Shae is a good friend of mine.


00:37:38.457 --> 00:37:40.468
Shae I love her.


00:37:40.492 --> 00:37:41.903
She's an artist.


00:37:41.927 --> 00:37:44.839
