00:43:31.843 --> 00:43:33.454
Hailey.


00:43:37.348 --> 00:43:39.284
Hailey, are you okay?


00:44:51.890 --> 00:44:52.991
Ow, damnit.


00:45:14.712 --> 00:45:15.546
Ah!


00:45:17.348 --> 00:45:19.226
