00:51:45.770 --> 00:51:49.174
It's just nice to meet
somebody who does.


00:52:14.332 --> 00:52:15.833
Come on, let's go.


00:52:17.134 --> 00:52:18.745
Where?


00:52:18.769 --> 00:52:23.016
