00:58:28.673 --> 00:58:29.506
Hey.


00:58:33.210 --> 00:58:34.044
Hey.


00:58:56.366 --> 00:58:57.811
Hey.


00:58:57.835 --> 00:59:00.947
If I get involved in
this and people find out,


00:59:00.971 --> 00:59:03.850
